  <li>Knauf plasterboard and jointing systems</li>
  <li>Tedlar or Celotex PIR insulation for thermal upgrades</li>
  <li>Rockwool mineral wool for acoustic and fire performance</li>
  <li>Tedlar PIR insulation for thermal upgrades</li>
  <li>Metal stud framing systems (50mm, 70mm, 92mm profiles)</li>
  <li>Timber stud framing where appropriate</li>
  <li>Intumescent sealants and cavity barriers</li>
  <li>Damp proof membranes and treatment products</li>
</ul>

